{{Documentation/Header}}
{{High Risk|Template:UtaiteGallery|nocat=1|pagetype=Main}}
Builds an automatic gallery of '''utaite''' pages. It runs a DPL query for every page that uses the {{T|Utaite}} infobox, then renders each result as a {{T|SingerBox}} card, pulling the utaite's name and image straight from their infobox.

Because the list is generated at render time, a new utaite page appears in the gallery automatically. See {{T|Singers}} for the equivalent gallery of {{T|Singer}} / {{T|Youtaite}} pages.

==Syntax==
{{T|UtaiteGallery|block=1
|v1=category =
|v2=beginwith =
|v3=endwith =
|v4=count =
|v5=titleregexp =
|v6=categoryregexp =
|v7=nottitleregexp =
|v8=cached =
}}

==Examples==
{{T|UtaiteGallery|_Y_=1|block=1
|p1=category = Male Utaite
|p2=beginwith = A
|p3=count = 6
}}
